  "title": "Creamy Baked Cheesecake",
  "description": "This condensed milk cheesecake is Eagle Brand's easy recipe for smooth and creamy baked cheesecake with sour cream, topped with cherry pie filling.",
  "authors": [
    "Eagle brand"
  ],
